Recommended:

| Purpose      | Recommended |
| ------------ | ----------- |
| User Traffic | 443         |
| Health Probe | 80 or 8080  |
| Probe Path   | /health     |

---

## Security

Never allow:

```text
SSH/RDP from Internet
```

Always restrict admin access.

